# Config, models and images arrive as mounts at run time, so a ROI change or a
# new model needs no rebuild.
#
# tests/ and tools/ DO ship, at about 20 KB. The test suite's transform section
# needs OpenCV, which only exists inside the image, so a suite that cannot run
# there is a suite that never runs against the thing actually deployed. And
# tools/grab.py is most useful on the box holding the camera, not on a laptop.
config.json
.env
data/
corpus/
models/
README.md
docker-compose.yml
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.git/
